  - Wieferich pseudoprimes
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the extension of OEIS A255885 from 24 to 85
  contiguous terms, with 23 additional exact noncontiguous values and the
  certified lower bound a(86) > 2000000000. It contains the C17/OpenMP
  production source, the independent arithmetic validator, compact campaign
  metadata, exact results, witness certificate, public validation scripts,
  and the provisional LaTeX manuscript source.
